# Linux platform

Native hosted Linux SDKs and providers implemented directly over libc and the
Linux userspace kernel ABI. No optional package or project link input is used,
with one exception: platforms/linux/sdl2 is an alternative display and touch
backend over SDL2, selected by a board rather than by the SDK, so nothing pays
for it unless a board binds it.
